Add the HP OmniBook 7 14-fr0xxx (board 8E3B) to the hp-wmi
charge_behaviour quirk table. The machine's DSDT contains the SBCO/SBCC
methods behind the HP BIOS WMI dispatch object, and the driver only
registers the power_supply extension after a successful GBCO read, so
this is safe for boards where the interface is absent.

Tested on HP OmniBook 7 14-fr0xxx (BIOS 94.19): inhibit-charge stops
charging on AC, auto restores charging. Candidate for submission
upstream.
--- a/drivers/platform/x86/hp/hp-wmi.c
+++ b/drivers/platform/x86/hp/hp-wmi.c
@@ -605,6 +605,13 @@
 			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_NAME, "8C15"),
 		},
 	},
+	{
+		/* HP OmniBook 7 14-fr0xxx */
+		.matches = {
+			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_VENDOR, "HP"),
+			DMI_MATCH(DMI_BOARD_NAME, "8E3B"),
+		},
+	},
 };
 #endif
 
